|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e|s |e|n |l|a|t|i|n |d|Ç|f|i|n|i|r |d|e|s |Ç|q|u|i|v|a|l|e|n|c|e|s |e|n|t|r|e |s|a|t|e|r|m|i|n|o|l|o|g|i|e |e|t |c|e|l|l|e |d|e|s |g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|i|e|n|s |i|n|d|i|g|ä|n|e|s. |I|l |e|s|t|p|r|Ç|o|c|c|u|p|Ç |d|e |c|o|m|p|r|e|n|d|r|e |l|e|u|r|s |c|o|n|c|e|p|t|i|o|n|s |e|t |s|e|m|b|l|e |s'|e|n |f|a|i|r|e|p|r|e|s|q|u|e |l|e |m|i|s|s|i|o|n|n|a|i|r|e|N|O|T|E|B |B|e|s|c|h|i |e|s|t |a|l|l|Ç |j|u|s|q|u'|Ö |Ç|c|r|i|r|e |u|n|e|g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e |t|a|m|o|u|l|e |e|n |t|a|m|o|u|l: |l|e |T|o|≠|≠|Â|l |V|i|Î|a|k|k|a|m, |c|o|n|s|t|i|t|u|Ç|e |d|e370 |s|Â|t|r|a (|v|e|r|s|i|f|i|Ç|s) |a|c|c|o|m|p|a|g|n|Ç|s |d'|u|n |c|o|m|m|e|n|t|a|i|r|e. |Q|u|a|n|t |Ö |s|a|t|r|o|i|s|i|ä|m|e |g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e |l|a|t|i|n|e, |l|a |C|l|a|v|i|s, |e|l|l|e |s|u|i|t |u|n |p|l|a|n |d|e|g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e |t|a|m|o|u|l|e. |C|e|p|e|n|d|a|n|t, |d|a|n|s |c|e|t |a|r|t|i|c|l|e, |j|e |m|e |l|i|m|i|t|e|r|a|i |Ö|u|n|e |p|r|e|m|i|ä|r|e |e|x|p|l|o|r|a|t|i|o|n |d|e |s|e|s |t|e|x|t|e|s |l|a|t|i|n|s, |c|o|n|f|r|o|n|t|Ç|s |Ö |l|e|u|r|s|t|r|a|d|u|c|t|i|o|n|s |e|n |a|n|g|l|a|i|s |d|o|n|t |l'|i|n|f|l|u|e|n|c|e |a |Ç|t|Ç |i|m|p|o|r|t|a|n|t|e, |e|t |m|e|c|o|n|c|e|n|t|r|e|r|a|i |s|u|r |l|e|s |d|e|u|x |p|r|e|m|i|ä|r|e|s |g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e|s.. |L|a |p|r|Ç|s|e|n|t|e|Ç|t|u|d|e, |l|i|m|i|t|Ç|e |Ö |l'|e|x|a|m|e|n |d|e|s |c|l|a|s|s|e|s |d|e |n|o|m|i|n|a, |a |p|o|u|r |o|b|j|e|t |d|e|r|e|s|i|t|u|e|r |l|e|s |c|o|n|c|e|p|t|i|o|n|s |d|e |B|e|s|c|h|i |d|a|n|s |u|n|e |h|i|s|t|o|i|r|e. |D'|u|n |c|ì|t|Ç|e|n |e|f|f|e|t, |c|e|l|l|e|s-|c|i |s'|e|n|r|a|c|i|n|e|n|t |d|a|n|s |l|a |g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e |l|a|t|i|n|e |e|t|B|e|s|c|h|i |n|e |f|o|r|g|e |p|a|s |d|e |t|e|r|m|e|s |l|a|t|i|n|s |n|o|u|v|e|a|u|x. |D'|u|n |a|u|t|r|e |c|ì|t|Ç,|c|o|n|f|r|o|n|t|Ç |Ö |u|n|e |l|a|n|g|u|e |d|e |s|t|r|u|c|t|u|r|e |d|i|f|f|Ç|r|e|n|t|e |d|e |c|e|l|l|e|s |q|u'|i|l|c|o|n|n|a|å|t, |i|l |e|s|t |a|m|e|n|Ç |Ö |o|p|Ç|r|e|r |d|e|s |a|d|a|p|t|a|t|i|o|n|s |q|u|i |p|e|r|m|e|t|t|r|o|n|t |Ö|s|e|s |s|u|c|c|e|s|s|e|u|r|s |d|e |s|e |r|Ç|c|l|a|m|e|r |d|e 