	|A|m|o|n|g |t|h|e |c|l|a|s|s |o|f |w|o|r|d|s |t|h|a|t |c|a|n |b|e |r|e|f|e|r|r|e|d |t|o |a|s|P|r|e|d|i|c|a|t|i|v|e|s, |V|e|r|b|s |f|o|r|m |a |s|e|p|a|r|a|t|e |c|l|a|s|s |a|s |t|h|e|y |i|n|f|l|e|c|t |f|o|r|T|e|n|s|e |w|h|i|l|e |a|l|l |o|t|h|e|r|s |d|o |n|o|t.
	|T|h|e |o|t|h|e|r |c|l|a|s|s |o|f |w|o|r|d|s |d|i|f|f|e|r |f|r|o|m |v|e|r|b|s |i|n |n|o|t |o|c|c|u|r|r|i|n|g|i|n |t|h|e |I|m|p|e|r|a|t|i|v|e |a|n|d |I|n|f|i|n|i|t|i|v|e |m|o|o|d|s |[...|]. |P|r|o|b|a|b|l|y |h|a|v|i|n|g |i|n|m|i|n|d |t|h|e |a|b|o|v|e |l|i|s|t|e|d |s|i|m|i|l|a|r|i|t|i|e|s |a|n|d |t|h|e |d|i|f|f|e|r|e|n|c|e|s, |t|h|i|s|c|l|a|s|s |o|f |w|o|r|d|s |a|r|e |r|e|f|e|r|r|e|d |t|o |a|s |v|i|≠|a|i-|k |k|u|ü|i|p|p|u |`|V|e|r|b|s |b|y|i|m|p|l|i|c|a|t|i|o|n' |b|y |t|r|a|d|i|t|i|o|n|a|l |g|r|a|m|m|a|r|i|a|n|s! |M|o|d|e|r|n |g|r|a|m|m|a|r|i|a|n|s |r|e|f|e|r|t|o |t|h|i|s |c|l|a|s|s |a|s |A|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|e |V|e|r|b|s. (|S|e|e |A|g|e|s|t|h|i|a|l|i|n|g|o|m |a|n|d|S|h|a|n|m|u|g|a|m, 1970)
	|A|s |t|h|e |t|e|r|m |`|a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|e' |i|s |m|a|i|n|l|y |a|s|s|o|c|i|a|t|e|d |w|i|t|h |N|o|u|n|s|a|n|d |n|a|m|i|n|g |a|s |t|h|i|s |c|l|a|s|s |i|s |s|h|o|w|n |a|b|o|v|e |t|o |b|e |d|i|s|t|i|n|c|t|l|y|d|i|f|f|e|r|e|n|t |f|r|o|m |N|o|u|n|s, |I |w|o|u|l|d |l|i|k|e |t|o |r|e|f|e|r |t|o |t|h|i|s |c|l|a|s|s |o|f|w|o|r|d|s |a|s |T|e|n|s|e|l|e|s|s |P|r|e|d|i|c|a|t|i|v|e|s (|T|l.|P|r.) |a|s |a |s|u|b-|c|l|a|s|s |o|f|P|r|e|d|i|c|a|t|i|v|e|s.

|A |u|n |a|u|t|r|e |e|n|d|r|o|i|t (|o|p.|c|i|t.|p.61), |K.|B|a|l|a|s|u|b|r|a|m|a|n|i|a|n |m|e|n|t|i|o|n|n|e|a|u|s|s|i |B|e|s|c|h|i |e|t |C|a|l|d|w|e|l|l |p|a|r|m|i |l|e|s |Æ|m|o|d|e|r|n |g|r|a|m|m|a|r|i|a|n|s|Ø |e|t |n|o|u|s|d|i|t, |Ö |p|r|o|p|o|s |d|e|s |v|i|≠|a|i|k |k|u|ü|i|p|p|u, |q|u'|i|l|s |Æ|r|e|f|e|r |t|o |t|h|i|s |c|l|a|s|s |o|f|w|o|r|d|s |a|s |A|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|e|s|Ø. |O|n |p|e|u|t |n|o|t|e|r |q|u'|i|l |n'|e|m|p|l|o|i|e |p|a|s |c|e|t|t|e|f|o|i|s |l'|e|x|p|r|e|s|s|i|o|n |Æ|a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|e |v|e|r|b|s|Ø, |c|e |e|n |q|u|o|i |i|l |d|i|f|f|ä|r|e |d|e|M|e|e|n|a|k|s|h|i|s|u|n|d|a|r|a|m |[1974|] |q|u|i |Ç|c|r|i|t (|p.205):

	|W|h|a|t |T|a|m|i|l |g|r|a|m|m|a|r|i|a|n|s |c|a|l|l |V|i|≠|a|i|k|k|u|ü|i|p|p|u |i|s |t|h|e |c|o|n|j|u|g|a|t|i|v|e|n|o|u|n |o|f |t|h|e |E|n|g|l|i|s|h |g|r|a|m|m|a|r|i|a|n|s |a|n|d |t|h|i|s |i|s |c|a|l|l|e|d |b|y |B|e|s|c|h|i |a|s|a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|e |v|e|r|b|s. |C|a|l|d|w|e|l|l |c|o|n|c|e|d|e|s |w|i|t|h |B|e|s|c|h|i |a|n|d |s|a|y|s |t|h|a|t |i|t|i|s |t|h|e |b|e|s|t |s|u|i|t|e|d |n|a|m|e.

|N|o|u|s |t|r|o|u|v|o|n|s |e|n |e|f|f|e|t |d|a|n|s |A |C|o|m|p|a|r|a|t|i|v|e |G|r|a|m|m|a|r |o|f |t|h|e|D|r|a|v|i|d|i|a|n |o|r |S|o|u|t|h-|I|n|d|i|a|n |F|a|m|i|l|y |o|f |l|a|n|g|u|a|g|e|s (|s|e|c|o|n|d |e|d|i|t|i|o|n,1875)|N|O|T|E|B |N|o|u|s |n'|a|v|o|n|s |m|a|l|h|e|u|r|e|u|s|e|m|e|n|t |p|u |c|o|n|s|u|l|t|e|r |q|u|e |l|e|r|e|t|i|r|a|g|e 1976 |d|e |l'|Ç|d|i|t|i|o|n |e|x|p|u|r|g|Ç|e (|v|o|i|r |l|a |E|d|i|t|o|r'|s |p|r|e|f|a|c|e |o|ó|i|l |e|s|t |d|i|t: |Æ|o|u|r |s|o|l|e |o|b|j|e|c|t |h|a|s |b|e|e|n |t|o |e|n|a|b|l|e |s|t|u|d|e|n|t|s |t|o|o|b|t|a|i|n |a|c|c|e|s|s |t|o |s|o |m|u|c|h |o|f |t|h|e |a|u|t|h|o|r'|s |w|o|r|k |a|s |r|e|t|a|i|n|s |a|p|e|r|m|a|n|e|n|t |v|a|l|u|e|Ø) |f|a|i|t|e |e|n 1956 (|e|t |a|p|p|e|l|Ç|e |Æ3|r|d |E|d|i|t|i|o|n|Ø) |p|a|r|l'|U|n|i|v|e|r|s|i|t|Ç |d|e |M|a|d|r|a|s |Ö |p|a|r|t|i|r |d|e |l|a |s|e|c|o|n|d|e |Ç|d|i|t|i|o|n., |d|a|n|s |l|a|p|a|r|t|i|e |V|I.9, |A|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|e |v|e|r|b|s, |o|r |c|o|n|j|u|g|a|t|e|d |n|o|u|n|s,|N|O|T|E|B |C|e|c|o|u|p|l|e |d|e |t|e|r|m|e|s |s|e |r|e|t|r|o|u|v|e |a|u|s|s|i |e|n |l|a|n|g|u|e |f|r|a|n|á|a|i|s|e, |a|v|e|c|d'|a|u|t|r|e|s |e|x|p|l|i|c|a|t|i|o|n|s, |d|a|n|s |B|L|O|C|H |[1946|] |d|a|n|s |l|e |c|h|a|p|i|t|r|e|i|n|t|i|t|u|l|Ç |Æ|N|o|m|s |p|r|o|n|o|m|i|n|a|l|i|s|Ç|s|Ø, |o|ó |n|o|u|s |l|i|s|o|n|s (|p.33):|Æ|[...|]|l|e|s |n|o|m|s |p|r|o|n|o|m|i|n|a|u|x |p|e|u|v|e|n|t |s|e |c|o|n|s|t|r|u|i|r|e |c|o|m|m|e|p|r|Ç|d|i|c|a|t|s, |e|t |[...|] |s|o|n|t |s|u|s|c|e|p|t|i|b|l|e|s |d'|a|v|o|i|r |s|u|j|e|t |e|t |r|Ç|g|i|m|e;|i|l|s |Ç|q|u|i|v|a|l|e|n|t |d|ä|s |l|o|r|s |e|x|a|c|t|e|m|e|n|t |Ö |d|e|s |v|e|r|b|e|s. |C'|e|s|t |c|e |q|u'|o|n |a|a|p|p|e|l|Ç |l|e|s |v|e|r|b|e|s |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|f|s, |o|u |n|o|m|s |c|o|n|j|u|g|u|Ç|s, |e|t |d|a|n|s |l|a|g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e |t|a|m|o|u|l|e, |k|u|R|i|p|p|u-|v|i|n|e|i |v|e|r|b|e|s |s|i|g|n|a|u|x |o|u |v|e|r|b|e|s |d|e|n|o|t|i|o|n, |s'|o|p|p|o|s|a|n|t |a|u|x |t|e|r|i-|n|i|l|e|i-|v|i|n|e|i, |v|e|r|b|e|s |e|x|p|l|i|c|i|t|e|s, |e|n |c|e|q|u'|i|l|s |n|e |f|o|n|t |q|u'|Ç|v|o|q|u|e|r |l|a |n|o|t|i|o|n |d|e |b|a|s|e, |s|a|n|s |n|o|t|e|r |c|o|m|m|e |l|e|s|s|e|c|o|n|d|s |l|a |p|o|s|i|t|i|o|n |d|a|n|s |l|e |t|e|m|p|s.|Ø |l|e|s |e|x|p|l|i|c|a|t|i|o|n|s |s|u|i|v|a|n|t|e|s:

	|[...|] |A|n|y |D|r|a|v|i|d|i|a|n |n|o|u|n |a|n|d |a|n|y |a|d|j|e|c|t|i|v|e |m|a|y |b|e |c|o|n|v|e|r|t|e|d|i|n|t|o |a |v|e|r|b |i|n |t|h|e |m|o|r|e |a|n|c|i|e|n|t |d|i|a|l|e|c|t|s |o|f |e|a|c|h |o|f |t|h|e |D|r|a|v|i|d|i|a|n|l|a|n|g|u|a|g|e|s |[...|] |T|a|m|i|l |g|r|a|m|m|a|r|i|a|n|s |c|a|l|l |t|h|e |v|e|r|b|s |h|e|r|e |d|e|s|c|r|i|b|e|d|v|i|n|e|i- (|k) |k|u|ü|i|p|p|u, |l|i|t|e|r|a|l|l|y |v|e|r|b|a|l |s|i|g|n|s; |a|n|d |t|h|e|y |h|a|v|e, |n|o|t|i|n|a|p|p|r|o|p|r|i|a|t|e|l|y, |b|e|e|n |s|t|y|l|e|d |c|o|n|j|u|g|a|t|e|d |n|o|u|n|s |b|y |a|n |E|n|g|l|i|s|h|w|r|i|t|e|r |o|n |T|a|m|i|l |g|r|a|m|m|a|r: |b|u|t |I |t|h|i|n|k |t|h|e |b|e|s|t |n|a|m|e |i|s |t|h|a|t |w|h|i|c|h|w|a|s |g|i|v|e|n |t|h|e|m |b|y |B|e|s|c|h|i --- |v|i|z., |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|e |v|e|r|b|s |o|r|c|o|n|j|u|g|a|t|e|d |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|e|s.

|C|e|p|e|n|d|a|n|t, |n|o|u|s |c|h|e|r|c|h|o|n|s |v|a|i|n|e|m|e|n|t |d|a|n|s |l|e|s |t|e|x|t|e|s |d|e |B|e|s|c|h|i (|o|u|p|l|u|t|ì|t |d|a|n|s |l|e|u|r|s |t|r|a|d|u|c|t|i|o|n|s |e|n |a|n|g|l|a|i|s) |l'|e|x|p|r|e|s|s|i|o|n|Æ|a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|e |v|e|r|b|s|Ø |q|u|i |l|u|i |e|s|t |a|t|t|r|i|b|u|Ç|e |p|a|r |C|a|l|d|w|e|l|l (|e|t |Ö |s|a|s|u|i|t|e |p|a|r |K.|M|e|e|n|a|k|s|h|i|s|u|n|d|a|r|a|m). |O|n |n|e |r|e|n|c|o|n|t|r|e |q|u|e |d|e|s|Æ|a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|e|s|Ø |e|t |d|e|s |Æ|a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|e |n|o|u|n|s|Ø. |D|a|n|s |l|a |s|u|i|t|e |d|e |c|e|t|t|e|Ç|t|u|d|e, |n|o|u|s |t|e|n|t|e|r|o|n|s |d|e |p|r|Ç|c|i|s|e|r |l|a |p|o|s|i|t|i|o|n |d|e |B|e|s|c|h|i.

2.2 |B|e|s|c|h|i |d|a|n|s |l|e |c|a|d|r|e |d|e |l|a |g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e |l|a|t|i|n|e
|S|i |B|e|s|c|h|i |l|a|i|s|s|e, |p|e|u|t-|à|t|r|e |s|a|n|s |l|e |s|a|v|o|i|r, |u|n|e |t|e|r|m|i|n|o|l|o|g|i|e |e|n|h|Ç|r|i|t|a|g|e |a|u|x |d|e|s|c|r|i|p|t|e|u|r|s |d|u |X|I|X|e |e|t |d|u |X|X|e, |i|l |e|s|t |l|u|i-|m|à|m|e |u|n|h|Ç|r|i|t|i|e|r, |c|o|m|m|e |o|n |p|e|u|t |l|e |v|o|i|r |a|u|x |t|a|b|l|e|s |d|e|s |m|a|t|i|ä|r|e|s |d|e |s|e|s|g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e|s. |A|i|n|s|i, |d|a|n|s |l|a |g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e |d|u |k|o|Ò|u|n |t|a|m|i|©, |c|o|n|s|a|c|r|Ç|e |Ö|l|a |l|a|n|g|u|e |o|r|d|i|n|a|i|r|e, |l|e |c|h|a|p|i|t|r|e |I|I. (|D|e |N|o|m|i|n|e |e|t |P|r|o|n|o|m|i|n|e) |s|e|d|i|v|i|s|e |e|n 5 |s|e|c|t|i|o|n|s:
	|D|e |D|e|c|l|i|n|a|t|i|o|n|e |N|o|m|i|n|u|m
	|D|e |A|d|j|e|c|t|i|v|i|s
	|D|e |P|r|o|n|o|m|i|n|i|b|u|s
	|D|e |P|r|o|n|o|m|i|n|e |A|d|j|e|c|t|i|v|o
	|D|e |G|e|n|e|r|i|b|u|s
|Q|u|a|n|t |Ö |l|a |g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e |d|u |c|e|n |t|a|m|i|©, |c|o|n|s|a|c|r|Ç|e |Ö |l|a |l|a|n|g|u|e|p|o|Ç|t|i|q|u|e, |l|e |s|e|c|o|n|d |c|h|a|p|i|t|r|e |d|e |s|a |p|r|e|m|i|ä|r|e |p|a|r|t|i|e |d|e |s|e |d|i|v|i|s|e|e|n 4 |s|e|c|t|i|o|n|s (|s|u|i|v|i|e|s |d'|u|n |A|p|p|e|n|d|i|x):
	|D|e |N|o|m|i|n|e,
	|D|e |N|o|m|i|n|e |A|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|o,
	|D|e |N|o|m|i|n|e |A|d|j|e|c|t|i|v|o,
	|D|e |P|r|o|n|o|m|i|n|i|b|u|s.
|S|i |B|e|s|c|h|i |m|e|t |p|l|u|s |e|n |Ç|v|i|d|e|n|c|e |l|e |n|o|m|e|n |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|u|m |d|a|n|s |s|o|n|e|x|p|o|s|Ç |s|u|r |l|a |l|a|n|g|u|e |p|o|Ç|t|i|q|u|e, |c|e|l|u|i-|c|i |n'|e|s|t |p|a|s |n|o|n |p|l|u|s |a|b|s|e|n|t|d|e |l'|a|u|t|r|e |g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e, |m|a|i|s |i|l |s'|y |t|r|o|u|v|e |r|e|j|e|t|Ç |d|a|n|s |l|e |c|h|a|p|i|t|r|e|I|V. (|D|e |S|y|n|t|a|x|i), |d|a|n|s |u|n|e |s|e|c|t|i|o|n |D|e |N|o|m|i|n|e, |q|u|e |l|e|s |Ç|d|i|t|e|u|r|s |d|e|B|e|s|c|h|i |s|Ç|p|a|r|e|n|t (|d|a|n|s |l|a |t|a|b|l|e |d|e|s |m|a|t|i|ä|r|e|s) |e|n |t|r|o|i|s|s|o|u|s-|s|e|c|t|i|o|n|s:
	|D|e |N|o|m|i|n|e |q|u|o|a|d |S|y|n|t|a|x|i|m,
	|D|e |N|o|m|i|n|i|b|u|s |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|i|s,
	|D|e |N|o|m|i|n|i|b|u|s |v|e|r|b|a|l|i|b|u|s.
