|P|a|r |l|a |s|u|i|t|e, |B|e|s|c|h|i |e|x|p|l|i|q|u|e |q|u|e |l|e|s |n|o|m|s |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|f|s |a|i|n|s|i|f|o|r|m|Ç|s |e|x|p|r|i|m|e|n|t |u|n|e |f|o|n|c|t|i|o|n (|o|f|f|i|c|i|u|m), |c|o|m|m|e |c|e|u|x |d|Ç|j|Ö |c|i|t|Ç|s,|o|u |u|n|e |p|a|s|s|i|o|n (|p|a|s|s|i|o) |d|u |c|o|r|p|s |o|u |d|e |l'|e|s|p|r|i|t, |c|o|m|m|e |k|ù|p|a|k|k|‡|ü|a|≠ |Æ|c|o|l|Ç|r|i|q|u|e|Ø (|i|r|a|c|u|n|d|u|s) |o|u |v|i|y|‡|t|i|k |k|‡|ü|a|≠ |Æ|i|n|f|i|r|m|e|Ø(|i|n|f|i|r|m|u|s). |M|a|i|s, |d|i|t-|i|l, |Æ|s|i |j|e |d|Ç|s|i|r|e |f|o|r|m|e|r |u|n |n|o|m |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|f|s|u|r |u|n |n|o|m |d|e |l|i|e|u, |c|o|m|m|e |n|o|u|s |d|i|s|o|n|s |R|o|m|a|i|n |Ö |p|a|r|t|i|r |d|e |R|o|m|e, |i|l|e|s|t |i|m|p|o|s|s|i|b|l|e |d'|a|j|o|u|t|e|r |k|‡|ü|‡|≠|Ø (|s|i |Ö |n|o|m|i|n|e |v. |g. |l|o|c|i |n|o|m|e|n|a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|u|m |f|o|r|m|a|r|e |v|e|l|i|m, |u|t |n|o|s |Ö |R|o|m|É, |R|o|m|a|n|u|m |d|i|c|i|m|u|s, |n|u|l|l|o|m|o|d|o |a|d|d|i |p|o|t|e|s|t |k|‡|ü|a|≠). |I|l |s|e|m|b|l|e |a|i|n|s|i |a|n|t|i|c|i|p|e|r |s|u|r |s|a|g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e |d|u |t|a|m|o|u|l |p|o|Ç|t|i|q|u|e |p|u|i|s|q|u'|i|l |o|p|p|o|s|e |p|a|r |e|x|e|m|p|l|e |l|a|f|o|r|m|e |r|i|d|i|c|u|l|e |Â|r|k|k|‡|ü|a|≠|N|O|T|E|B |I|l |s'|a|g|i|t |d'|u|n|e |f|o|r|m|e |p|o|p|u|l|a|i|r|e|a|t|t|e|s|t|Ç|e |a|u|j|o|u|r|d'|h|u|i |e|n|c|o|r|e. |B|e|s|c|h|i |r|e|j|e|t|t|e |d|e|s |f|o|r|m|e|s |s|e|m|b|l|a|b|l|e|s|e|n |d|i|s|a|n|t |q|u|e |l|e|s |e|m|p|l|o|y|e|r |f|e|r|a|i|t |r|i|r|e |m|à|m|e |l|e|s |v|i|e|i|l|l|e|s(|i|r|r|i|d|e|r|e|n|t |v|e|l |i|p|s|ë |v|e|t|u|l|ë). |I|l |r|e|s|t|e |q|u|e |l|e |k|o|Ò|u|n |t|a|m|i|© |q|u'|i|l|d|Ç|c|r|i|t --- |d|a|n|s |s|a |p|r|Ç|f|a|c|e |i|l |l'|o|p|p|o|s|e |a|u |c|e|n |t|a|m|i|© |c|o|m|m|e|c|o|m|m|u|n|e|m |Ö |s|u|b|l|i|m|e|m |o|u |c|o|m|m|e |a|s|p|e|r|u|m |Ö |e|l|e|g|a|n|t|e|m --- |n'|e|s|t |p|a|s|u|n|e |l|a|n|g|u|e |p|o|p|u|l|a|i|r|e. |Ö |l|a |f|o|r|m|e |Ç|l|Ç|g|a|n|t|e |Â|r|‡|≠ |Æ|v|i|l|l|a|g|e|o|i|s|Ø(|o|p|p|i|d|a|n|u|s), |f|o|r|m|Ç|e |s|u|r |Â|r |Æ|v|i|l|l|a|g|e|Ø (|o|p|p|i|d|u|m). |L|e |r|e|s|t|e |d|e |l|a|s|e|c|t|i|o|n |e|s|t |c|o|n|s|a|c|r|Ç |Ö |e|x|a|m|i|n|e|r |l|e|s |p|r|o|c|Ç|d|Ç|s |Ç|l|Ç|g|a|n|t|s. |A|u|p|a|s|s|a|g|e, |i|l |r|e|f|u|s|e |d'|a|p|p|e|l|e|r |n|o|m|s |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|f|s |d|e|s |c|o|n|s|t|r|u|c|t|i|o|n|s|p|Ç|r|i|p|h|r|a|s|t|i|q|u|e|s |c|o|m|m|e |‡|Ô|k|‡|r|a|m|u|Î|Î|a|v|a|≠, |q|u'|i|l |t|r|a|d|u|i|t |d'|a|b|o|r|d |p|a|r|s|u|p|e|r|b|u|s |p|u|i|s |p|a|r |i|l|l|e |q|u|i |h|a|b|e|t |s|u|p|e|r|b|i|a|m. |I|l |s|e |j|u|s|t|i|f|i|e |e|n|d|i|s|a|n|t |q|u'|i|l |s'|a|g|i|t |d|e |s|y|n|t|a|g|m|e|s (|h|ë|c |n|o|n |n|o|m|i|n|a |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|a, |s|e|d|p|h|r|a|s|e|s |d|i|c|i |d|e|b|e|n|t). |C|e|t|t|e |r|e|s|t|r|i|c|t|i|o|n |s|e|m|b|l|e |v|i|s|e|r |l'|u|s|a|g|e|t|e|r|m|i|n|o|l|o|g|i|q|u|e |i|n|c|o|n|t|r|o|l|Ç |d'|a|u|t|r|e|s |d|e|s|c|r|i|p|t|e|u|r|s|N|O|T|E|B |C|e|u|x-|c|i|Ç|t|a|n|t |d|Ç|s|i|g|n|Ç|s |s|e|u|l|e|m|e|n|t |p|a|r |a|l|i|q|u|i, |j|e |n'|a|i |p|u |d|Ç|t|e|r|m|i|n|e|r |s'|i|l|s'|a|g|i|s|s|a|i|t |d'|u|n |r|e|n|v|o|i |Ö |d'|a|u|t|r|e|s |o|u|v|r|a|g|e|s |o|u |b|i|e|n |d|e |l|a|r|Ç|f|u|t|a|t|i|o|n |d|e |t|h|ä|s|e|s |c|i|r|c|u|l|a|n|t |o|r|a|l|e|m|e|n|t |d|a|n|s |l|e|s |c|e|r|c|l|e|s |o|ó |l'|o|n|a|p|p|r|e|n|a|i|t |l|e |t|a|m|o|u|l |a|v|e|c |l|e |l|a|t|i|n |p|o|u|r |m|Ç|t|a|l|a|n|g|u|e. |I|l |n|e |s|e|m|b|l|e|e|n |t|o|u|t |c|a|s |p|a|s |v|i|s|e|r |Z|i|e|g|e|n|b|a|l|g |p|u|i|s|q|u|e |c|e|l|u|i-|c|i |n|e |p|a|r|l|e |p|a|s |d|e|n|o|m|i|n|a |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|a..

2.4 |B|e|s|c|h|i |e|t |l|e|s |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|f|s |d|a|n|s |l|a |l|a|n|g|u|e |p|o|Ç|t|i|q|u|e
|A|l|o|r|s |q|u|e |n|o|u|s |v|e|n|o|n|s |d|e |l|e |v|o|i|r |d|a|n|s |c|e|t|t|e |p|r|e|m|i|ä|r|e |g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e|c|o|n|t|r|a|s|t|e|r |d|e|s |n|o|m|s |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|f|s |c|o|m|m|e |t|ù|Ò|Ò|a|k |k|‡|ü|a|≠ |Æ|j|a|r|d|i|n|i|e|r|Ø(|h|o|r|t|u|l|a|n|u|s) |Ö |d|e|s |n|o|m|s |s|u|b|s|t|a|n|t|i|f|s |c|o|m|m|e |t|ù|Ò|Ò|a|m |Æ|j|a|r|d|i|n|Ø(|h|o|r|t|u|s), |n|o|u|s |t|r|o|u|v|o|n|s |u|n |s|y|s|t|ä|m|e |d|i|f|f|Ç|r|e|n|t |d|a|n|s |s|a |g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e |d|u|t|a|m|o|u|l |p|o|Ç|t|i|q|u|e (|c|e|n |t|a|m|i|©). |E|n |e|f|f|e|t, |a|p|r|ä|s |a|v|o|i|r |d|a|n|s |l|a|s|e|c|t|i|o|n |D|e |N|o|m|i|n|e |e|x|p|l|i|q|u|Ç |c|o|m|m|e|n|t |f|o|n|c|t|i|o|n|n|e |l|a |d|Ç|c|l|i|n|a|i|s|o|n |d|e|s|n|o|m|s, |B|e|s|c|h|i |i|d|e|n|t|i|f|i|e |d|ä|s |l|e |d|Ç|b|u|t |d|e |l|a |s|e|c|t|i|o|n |D|e |N|o|m|i|n|e|A|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|o, |l'|o|p|p|o|s|i|t|i|o|n |l|a|t|i|n|e |e|n|t|r|e |l|e|s |n|o|m|i|n|a |p|r|o|p|r|i|a |e|t |l|e|s|n|o|m|i|n|a |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|a |a|v|e|c |u|n|e |o|p|p|o|s|i|t|i|o|n |q|u'|i|l |r|e|p|r|e|n|d |d|u |N|a|≠|≠|Â|l,|u|n |t|r|a|i|t|Ç |g|r|a|m|m|a|t|i|c|a|l |t|a|m|o|u|l |m|Ç|d|i|Ç|v|a|l, |e|n|t|r|e |l|e|s |p|a|k|u|p|a|t|a|m |e|t |l|e|s|p|a|k|‡|p|p|a|t|a|m. |I|l |e|x|p|l|i|q|u|e:

