|N|o|u|s |a|v|o|n|s |v|u |q|u|e |C|a|l|d|w|e|l|l |a|t|t|r|i|b|u|a|i|t |Ö |B|e|s|c|h|i |d|e|s |Æ|a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|e|v|e|r|b|s |o|r |c|o|n|j|u|g|a|t|e|d |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|e|s|Ø. |S|i |l|a |p|r|e|m|i|ä|r|e |e|x|p|r|e|s|s|i|o|n |n|e|s|e|m|b|l|e |p|a|s |c|o|r|r|e|s|p|o|n|d|r|e |Ö |u|n |t|e|r|m|e |e|m|p|l|o|y|Ç |p|a|r |B|e|s|c|h|i |e|t |a|u|r|a|i|t|f|a|i|t |s|o|r|t|i|r |s|e|s |o|p|p|o|s|i|t|i|o|n|s |d|e |b|a|s|e |d'|u|n |s|c|h|Ç|m|a |t|e|r|n|a|i|r|e |n|o|m|e|n|p|r|o|p|r|i|u|m|N|O|T|E|B |M|à|m|e |s|i |c|e |t|e|r|m|e |n'|e|s|t |p|a|s |d|a|n|s |l|a |t|a|b|l|e |d|e|s|m|a|t|i|ä|r|e|s, |n|o|u|s |a|v|o|n|s |v|u |q|u'|i|l |f|i|g|u|r|e |e|n |b|o|n|n|e |p|l|a|c|e |d|a|n|s |l|e|t|e|x|t|e. |C|e|p|e|n|d|a|n|t, |n|o|u|s |v|e|r|r|o|n|s |a|u|s|s|i |B|e|s|c|h|i |c|o|n|t|r|a|s|t|e|r |n|o|m|e|n|s|u|b|s|t|a|n|t|i|v|u|m |e|t |n|o|m|e|n |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|u|m., |n|o|m|e|n |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|u|m, |n|o|m|e|n|a|d|j|e|c|t|i|v|u|m, |l|a |s|e|c|o|n|d|e |e|x|p|r|e|s|s|i|o|n |n|e |t|r|a|h|i|t |p|a|s |B|e|s|c|h|i |e|t |l'|o|n|p|e|u|t |p|e|n|s|e|r |q|u|e |C|a|l|d|w|e|l|l, |q|u|i |n'|a|v|a|i|t |s|a|n|s |d|o|u|t|e |p|a|s |c|o|m|m|e |B|e|s|c|h|i|e|n|s|e|i|g|n|Ç |l|a |g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e |l|a|t|i|n|e|N|O|T|E|B |V|o|i|r |s|u|p|r|a, |e|n |n|o|t|e, |l|e|s |a|n|n|Ç|e|s|d|e |f|o|r|m|a|t|i|o|n |d|e |B|e|s|c|h|i |c|h|e|z |l|e|s |j|Ç|s|u|i|t|e|s. |Q|u|a|n|t |a|u |Æ|R|e|v. |D|r.|B|i|s|h|o|p|Ø |R|o|b|e|r|t |C|a|l|d|w|e|l|l (1814--1891), |m|i|s|s|i|o|n|n|a|i|r|e |p|r|o|t|e|s|t|a|n|t|Ç|c|o|s|s|a|i|s, |i|l |a |e|u |s|e|l|o|n |K.|M|e|e|n|a|k|s|h|i|s|u|n|d|a|r|a|m (|o|p.|c|i|t.|p.34) |u|n|e|f|o|r|m|a|t|i|o|n |i|n|i|t|i|a|l|e |e|n |Æ|c|o|m|p|a|r|a|t|i|v|e |p|h|i|l|o|l|o|g|y|Ø |Ö |G|l|a|s|g|o|w. |e|t|n'|Ç|t|a|i|t |d|o|n|c |p|a|s |e|n|f|e|r|m|Ç |d|a|n|s |u|n |c|a|d|r|e |t|e|r|m|i|n|o|l|o|g|i|q|u|e |r|i|g|i|d|e,|p|o|u|v|a|i|t |t|i|r|e|r |l|e|s |c|o|n|s|Ç|q|u|e|n|c|e|s |d|e |l|a |m|a|n|i|ä|r|e |d|e |s'|e|x|p|r|i|m|e|r |d|e|B|e|s|c|h|i |e|t |f|o|r|g|e|r |l|u|i-|m|à|m|e, |a|p|p|a|r|