|P|r|ë|t|e|r|e|a |q|u|o|d |h|u|i|c |l|i|n|g|u|ë |o|m|n|i|n|o |s|i|n|g|u|l|a|r|e |e|s|s|e |c|e|n|s|e|o: |n|o|m|i|n|a|o|m|n|i|a |a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|a |d|e|c|l|i|n|a|n|t|u|r |q|u|i|d|e|m |m|o|d|o |n|o|m|i|n|u|m |s|u|b|s|t|a|n|t|i|v|o|r|u|m;|a|t |q|u|ë |f|i|u|n|t |v|e|l |j|u|x|t|a |m|o|d|u|m 5|@+|[|ë|] |r|a|d|i|c|i|s |v|e|l |a|b |o|b|l|i|q|u|o|c|u|j|u|s|q|u|e |n|o|m|i|n|i|s; |e|t |d|e|c|l|i|n|a|n|t|u|r |p|e|r |o|m|n|e|s |c|a|s|u|s |u|t |n|o|m|i|n|a, |e|t|c|o|n|j|u|g|a|n|t|u|r |p|e|r |o|m|n|e|s |p|e|r|s|o|n|a|s |u|t |v|e|r|b|a, |e|t |t|u|n|c |v|o|c|a|n|t|u|r |v|i|≠|a|i|k|k|u|ü|i|p|p|u, |s|i|g|n|u|m |v|e|r|b|i, |s|c|l. |n|o|m|e|n |i|n|d|i|c|a|n|s |a|l|i|q|u|a|m |a|c|t|i|o|n|e|m |s|e|u|p|o|s|s|e|s|s|i|o|n|e|m |v|e|r|b|i: |s|i|c |v.|g. |p|Â|ı|i|≠|a|≠, |p|Â|ı|i|≠|a|≠|a|i, |p|Â|ı|i|≠|a|≠|a|i,|[...|], |e|t |s|i|c |d|e |c|ë|t|e|r|i|s. |P|r|ë|t|e|r|e|a |j|u|x|t|a |t|e|r|m|i|n|a|t|i|o|n|e|s |h|u|j|u|s|d|i|a|l|e|c|t|i, |d|e |q|u|i|b|u|s |i|n|f|r|a, |c|o|n|j|u|g|a|n|t|u|r |u|t |v|e|r|b|a |p|e|r |o|m|n|e|s|p|e|r|s|o|n|a|s, |s|i|c |n|‡|≠ |p|Â|ı|i|≠|õ|≠, |n|„ |p|Â|ı|i|≠|a|i, |[...|]; |e|t |h|o|c |m|o|d|o|s|i|g|n|i|f|i|c|a|n|t |u|t |v|e|r|b|a |e|t |e|x|p|l|e|n|t |o|r|a|t|i|o|n|e|m; |s|i|g|n|i|f|i|c|a|n|t |h|ë|c: |e|g|o|h|a|b|e|o |t|o|r|q|u|e|m |e|x |g|e|m|m|i|s, |t|u |h|a|b|e|s...|e|t|c.;

