	|I|n |t|h|i|s |l|a|n|g|u|a|g|e |t|h|e|r|e |i|s |a |p|e|c|u|l|i|a|r|i|t|y, |w|h|i|c|h, |I |b|e|l|i|e|v|e,|w|i|l|l |n|o|t |b|e |f|o|u|n|d |i|n |a|n|y |o|t|h|e|r. |I|t |i|s |t|h|i|s, |t|h|a|t, |w|h|i|l|s|t|a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|e|s |i|n |g|e|n|e|r|a|l |a|r|e |d|e|c|l|i|n|e|d |t|h|r|o|u|g|h |a|l|l |t|h|e |c|a|s|e|s, |l|i|k|e|n|o|u|n|s |s|u|b|s|t|a|n|t|i|v|e, |t|h|o|s|e |w|h|i|c|h |a|r|e |f|o|r|m|e|d |e|i|t|h|e|r |f|r|o|m |t|h|e |f|i|f|t|h|h|e|a|d |o|f |p|r|i|m|i|t|i|v|e|s, |o|r |f|r|o|m |t|h|e |o|b|l|i|q|u|e |o|f |a|n|y |n|o|u|n |w|h|a|t|e|v|e|r, |a|r|e|a|l|s|o |c|o|n|j|u|g|a|t|e|d |t|h|r|o|u|g|h |a|l|l |t|h|e |p|e|r|s|o|n|s, |l|i|k|e |v|e|r|b|s. |I|n |t|h|i|s|c|a|s|e, |t|h|e|y |a|r|e |c|a|l|l|e|d |v|i|≠|a|i|k |k|u|ü|i|p|p|u |t|h|e |s|i|g|n |o|f |t|h|e |v|e|r|b; |t|h|a|t|i|s, |n|o|u|n|s |s|e|r|v|i|n|g, |l|i|k|e |a |v|e|r|b, |t|o |e|x|p|r|e|s|s |s|o|m|e |a|c|t|i|o|n |o|r|p|a|s|s|i|o|n: |t|h|u|s, |v|e|ü|p|i|≠|a|≠ |h|e |d|w|e|l|l|s |o|n |a |m|o|u|n|t|a|i|n.
