3.1 |I|n|t|e|r|a|c|t|i|o|n |a|v|e|c |l|e |p|o|i|n|t |d|e |v|u|e |t|r|a|d|i|t|i|o|n|n|e|l |t|a|m|o|u|l
|B|e|s|c|h|i |Ç|t|a|i|t |c|o|n|f|r|o|n|t|Ç |Ö |u|n |d|o|u|b|l|e |p|r|o|b|l|ä|m|e: |i|l |d|e|v|a|i|t |d'|u|n|e |p|a|r|t|f|o|u|r|n|i|r |u|n|e |d|e|s|c|r|i|p|t|i|o|n |d|u |t|a|m|o|u|l |u|t|i|l|i|s|a|b|l|e |f|a|c|i|l|e|m|e|n|t |p|a|r|d'|a|u|t|r|e|s |m|i|s|s|i|o|n|a|i|r|e|s |e|u|r|o|p|Ç|e|n|s, |c|e |q|u|i |l'|a|m|e|n|a|i|t |Ö |c|o|n|s|e|r|v|e|r |u|n|p|l|a|n |d|e |g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e |l|a|t|i|n|e. |I|l |v|o|u|l|a|i|t |a|u|s|s|i, |s|e|m|b|l|e-|t-|i|l, |d|o|n|n|e|r|d|i|r|e|c|t|e|m|e|n|t |a|c|c|ä|s |Ö |l|a |t|r|a|d|i|t|i|o|n |g|r|a|m|m|a|t|i|c|a|l|e |t|a|m|o|u|l|e |e|l|l|e-|m|à|m|e,|c|e |q|u|i |l|u|i |p|o|s|a|i|t |d|e |d|i|f|f|i|c|i|l|e|s |p|r|o|b|l|ä|m|e|s |t|e|r|m|i|n|o|l|o|g|i|q|u|e|s. |E|n|e|f|f|e|t, |l|e|s |g|r|a|m|m|a|i|r|e|s |t|a|m|o|u|l|e|s |l|u|i |f|o|u|r|n|i|s|s|a|i|e|n|t |u|n|e |l|i|s|t|e|c|a|n|o|n|i|q|u|e |d|e |q|u|a|t|r|e |p|a|r|t|i|e|s |d|u |d|i|s|c|o|u|r|s: |p|e|y|a|r|c |c|o|l |Æ|n|o|m|s|Ø,|v|i|≠|a|i|c |c|o|l |Æ|v|e|r|b|e|s|Ø, |i|Ò|a|i|c |c|o|l |Æ|p|a|r|t|i|c|u|l|e|s|Ø, |u|r|i|c |c|o|l |Æ|m|o|t|s|p|r|o|p|r|e|s|Ø. |D|a|n|s |c|e|t|t|e |l|i|s|t|e, |l|e |s|e|c|o|n|d |t|e|r|m|e |e|t |l|e |q|u|a|t|r|i|ä|m|e |t|e|r|m|e|Ç|t|a|i|e|n|t |l|e|s |p|l|u|s |d|i|f|f|i|c|i|l|e |Ö |e|x|p|l|i|q|u|e|r. |E|n |e|f|f|e|t, |l|e|s |v|e|r|b|e|s(|v|i|≠|a|i|c |c|o|l) |c|o|m|p|o|r|t|a|i|e|n|t |u|n|e |s|o|u|s-|c|l|a|s|s|e |d|Ç|j|Ö |r|e|n|c|o|n|t|r|Ç|e |p|a|r|n|o|u|s: |l|e|s |v|i|≠|a|i|k |k|u|ü|i|p|p|u |Æ|v|e|r|b|e|s |i|d|Ç|e|l|s|Ø|N|O|T|E|B |A |p|a|r|t |l'|e|x|p|r|e|s|s|i|o|n|Æ|a|p|p|e|l|l|a|t|i|v|e |v|e|r|b|s|Ø, |r|a|p|p|e|l|l|o|n|s |l|e|s |d|i|f|f|Ç|r|e|n|t|e|s |t|r|a|d|u|c|t|i|o|n|s |o|u|e|x|p|l|i|c|a|t|i|o|n|s |d|Ç|j|Ö |m|e|n|t|i|o|n|n|Ç|e|s: |Æ|V|e|r|b|s |b|y |i|m|p|l|i|c|a|t|i|o|n|Ø(|B|a|l|a|s|u|b|r|a|m|a|n|i|a|m); |Æ|v|e|r|b|e|s |s|i|g|n|a|u|x|Ø |o|u |Æ|v|e|r|b|e|s |d|e |n|o|t|i|o|n|Ø(|B|l|o|c|h); |Æ|v|e|r|b|a|l |s|i|g|n|s|Ø (|C|a|l|d|w|e|l|l); |Æ|s|i|g|n|u|m |v|e|r|b|i|Ø (|B|e|s|c|h|i).|E|n|f|i|n, |d|a|n|s |l|e |c|a|d|r|e |d|e |m|o|n |Ç|t|u|d|e |d|u |C|